error[L0520]: the result of `adder` keeps a borrow of a temporary
  --> check/returned_generic_closure_keeps_temporary.knv:33:19
   |
30 | (defn adder (x) (fn (y) (+ (rank x) y)))
   |              - the returned closure keeps this borrow of `x`
...
33 |   (local f (adder (make-ledger 3)))
   |                   ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ this temporary is dropped at the end of the statement
   |
   = help: bind the argument with `let` before the statement that binds the result, so it lives as long as the result
   = note: run `knave doc L0520` for an explanation

